-- wainscot colour/material, floor (material + an optional painted pattern: checker, tiles,
-- grating, carpet border, planks), ceiling (a glass roof for the greenhouse/conservatory, a
-- star dome for the observatory), chandelier light colour, trim metal, a furniture kit
-- (ManorDecor.Kits) and a wall-art set (ArtGui kinds: portrait, landscape, blueprint, botanical,
-- starchart, airship, clock, mirror, banner, sconce). Colours are Config/Style palette names.
-- Materials are Enum.Material names (kept as strings so this stays a pure, testable module).
